    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86384" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρῑον-ωτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (as if from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πριονόω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>made
				like a saw, jagged, serrated,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόμια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					58
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ κρανίου] τὸ π. μέρος ῥαφὴ
				[καλεῖται</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				516a15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δράκοντες</span>”
				<i>with serrated crests,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					3.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῇ λοφίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.Jun.
					<u>Im.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ π. τειχοποιία,</span> of a
			warlike engine, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				83.8
			</span></i>.</div>
